## Upstream Project & Original Work Attribution

ValorantStoreCheck is derived and extensively enhanced from SkinPeek:

```text
SkinPeek (VALORANT Daily Store Discord Bot)
Copyright (C) Giorgio (giorgi-o) (<https://github.com/giorgi-o/SkinPeek>)
Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0
```

Key enhancements introduced by KriZad:

- High-resolution 2x2 Canvas storefront composite banners using `@napi-rs/canvas`
- Cloudflare Turnstile & hCaptcha bypass via modern SSID Web Auth Portal & Helper Bookmarklet
- Multi-account switching and profile management for Discord users
- Cloud and web hosting keep-alive resiliency (Express HTTP `/health` server)
- HenrikDev Unofficial Valorant API integration for player cards, rank, and live MMR inspection
- Kingdom Credits and new weapon support (Accessory shop, Outlaw sniper)

